{
  "note": "Functional needs, not medical categories. This is the PRIMARY index: every rule and every fixture names the needs it serves, because one requirement usually serves several groups at once. A keyboard-access rule supports blind users, motor-impaired users, switch users and many speech-input users — indexing by criterion alone hides that.",
  "source": "https://www.w3.org/WAI/people-use-web/abilities-barriers/",
